From 09c584b695db5f288426e3bbd026e069ccf0576a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Denys Zarubin <den99f@me.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 22:28:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] EU Cloud Price Index: generator, first monthly data, docs

Server lists from AWS, Azure, Google Cloud (via Cyclenerd's price list),
UpCloud, Scaleway and OVHcloud price APIs; Hetzner from its website until
an API token is set. Unit prices (storage, egress, load balancer,
Kubernetes, PostgreSQL) in data/manual.json, each with its source.
